  "priorExpiration": "2005-01-10",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1620.02 Prohibited Acts.\n\n(a) No person shall smoke, carry matches or any other flame-producing device or carry any unauthorized firearms or loaded cartridges while in or within 50 feet of a motor vehicle transporting explosive materials.\n\n(b) No person shall park his/her motor vehicle transporting explosive materials within 300 feet of an open fire.\n\n(c) The driver shall load or unload a vehicle transporting explosive materials in compliance with 49 CFR 177.834 through 177.844.\n\nSource. #2220, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2837, eff 8-27-84; ss by #4584, eff 3-3-89; ss by #5996, INTERIM, eff 3-3-95, EXPIRES, 7-1-95; ss by #6054, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8116, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRES: 1-10-05; ss by #8231, eff 12-20-04; ss by #10396, eff 8-15-13",
